Available Commands:
  check       Refuse one name and hand the error back
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  guide       Show what a wrapped help block looks like
  help        Help about any command
  plain       Print help through a help func of its own
  say         Print one word through the out sink

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for sinks
